          "text": "The pattern indexes as monoclinic **C2/c** (No. 15), with a C-centered mC56 cell and \\(Z=8\\). Diagnostic assignments include 200 at 10.43\u00b0, \\(11\\bar1\\) at 14.06\u00b0, 111 at 18.14\u00b0, 020 at 18.90\u00b0, and overlapping 400/\\(20\\bar2\\) near 20.94\u00b0. The refined metric is approximately \\(a=19.77\\), \\(b=9.38\\), \\(c=8.53\\) \u00c5, \\(\\beta=121.0^\\circ\\).\n\nThe coordinates below are a symmetry-constrained La\\(_5\\)Ir\\(_2\\)-type starting model. The lattice and space group are considerably more secure than the individual coordinates; publication-quality coordinates would require a full Rietveld refinement with the instrumental profile.\n\n```cif\ndata_La5Ir2\n_audit_creation_method\n'Powder indexing and symmetry-constrained La5Ir2-type starting model'\n\n_chemical_name_common                 'pentalanthanum diiridium'\n_chemical_formula_sum                 'La5 Ir2'\n_chemical_formula_structural          'La5Ir2'\n_cell_formula_units_Z                 8\n\n_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M        'C 1 2/c 1'\n_space_group_name_H-M_alt             'C 1 2/c 1'\n_space_group_IT_number                15\n\n_cell_length_a                        19.77\n_cell_length_b                         9.381\n_cell_length_c                         8.527\n_cell_angle_alpha                     90\n_cell_angle_beta                     121.00\n_cell_angle_gamma                     90\n_cell_volume                        1355.4\n\n_exptl_crystal_density_diffrn         10.58\n_diffrn_radiation_type                'Cu Kalpha1'\n_diffrn_radiation_wavelength           1.5406\n\nloop_\n_space_group_symop_id\n_space_group_symop_operation_xyz\n1  'x,y,z'\n2  '-x,y,-z+1/2'\n3  '-x,-y,-z'\n4  'x,-y,z+1/2'\n5  'x+1/2,y+1/2,z'\n6  '-x+1/2,y+1/2,-z+1/2'\n7  '-x+1/2,-y+1/2,-z'\n8  'x+1/2,-y+1/2,z+1/2'\n\nloop_\n_atom_site_label\n_atom_site_type_symbol\n_atom_site_symmetry_multiplicity\n_atom_site_Wyckoff_symbol\n_atom_site_fract_x\n_atom_site_fract_y\n_atom_